---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy">
  <section class="section paper">
    <article class="container narrow prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy & enquiries.</h1>
      <h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
      <p>
        The enquiry list and item notes are stored in your browser’s localStorage. Clear the list or
        browser site data to remove them.
      </p>
      <h2>Enquiry records for SHK follow-up</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit the requirement form, the contact and requirement information you provide
        may be recorded in SHK’s private enquiry workspace so the team can respond, prepare a
        quotation and manage follow-up. Access to that workspace is restricted to authorised SHK
        staff.
      </p>
      <h2>Sending a requirement</h2>
      <p>
        The form generates a WhatsApp link containing the information you enter. The website also
        attempts to record the same enquiry details for SHK follow-up. Opening WhatsApp shares the
        message with WhatsApp only after you review and send it. WhatsApp’s own privacy terms apply.
      </p>
      <h2>Drawings and attachments</h2>
      <p>
        Selected files are not uploaded to this website or transferred through a WhatsApp link. Only
        their filenames are included in the generated message. Attach files yourself in the WhatsApp
        conversation.
      </p>
      <h2>Analytics and hosting</h2>
      <p>
        This build uses no analytics scripts or advertising cookies. The hosting provider may
        process ordinary request logs when the site is deployed.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Contact <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> about information
        you share with SHK.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
